MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Day and Week show the hours side by side (scrolls inside the card, opens an
  hour before now): each timed event a block in its calendar's colour,
  overlaps split into lanes (DayAgendaSource.layoutDay), a line at the
  current time; all-day events and the day's Google Tasks (circle, like a
  reminder) sit in a strip above.
- Week has a header of day names and numbers (today circled); Month lists
  the first events and tasks inside each day with "+N"; tapping a day opens
  it in the Day view.
- Events carry their DISPLAY_COLOR from the calendar store.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
